WEBVTT

00:05.260 --> 00:08.320
Why? Why are you going?

00:10.040 --> 00:12.930
Please. Don't go.

00:24.670 --> 00:26.100
I hate it.

00:26.100 --> 00:28.630
I hate it, I hate it, I hate it, I hate it!

00:29.180 --> 00:30.260
I hate it!

00:31.380 --> 00:34.470
I hate Christmas.

00:35.770 --> 00:37.890
That's right. I hate it.

00:40.980 --> 00:47.440
So the scary, evil Black Santa will ruin everything.

00:47.440 --> 00:49.760
The birth of an urban legend.

00:49.760 --> 00:51.370
Children trembling in terror.

00:51.370 --> 00:53.300
Let the sun rise to screams.

00:53.300 --> 00:55.910
This year's holy night won't be merry!

02:15.780 --> 02:19.470
Hi, kids in front of the screen.
To what age did you believe in Santa Claus?

02:19.470 --> 02:20.960
More like, when did Santa Claus disappear?!

02:20.960 --> 02:22.750
If he's gone, then you become the new one!

02:22.750 --> 02:25.040
Stop sitting around! The bells will toll in a few months!

02:47.580 --> 02:48.270
Ouka!

02:48.270 --> 02:50.920
Oukaoukaoukaoukaouka!

02:50.920 --> 02:52.310
What's the yelling for?

02:52.310 --> 02:53.800
Why didn't you tell me before?!

02:53.800 --> 02:54.390
Huh?

02:54.390 --> 02:55.950
Look at this!

02:55.950 --> 02:57.110
What is this?

02:57.110 --> 02:58.610
A picture book!

02:58.610 --> 03:00.540
I can tell that.

03:00.540 --> 03:01.890
I'm talking about Christmas!

03:01.890 --> 03:08.870
It says every year on Dec. 24th, there's a wonderful lucky event where you get a free gift from a jolly old man called Santa Claus!

03:08.870 --> 03:11.440
Ouka, you knew about this
and kept it a secret from me, didn't you?

03:11.440 --> 03:14.820
Wait, you didn't know what Christmas is?

03:15.710 --> 03:21.140
At my home, Shangri-La, there is no happy-go-lucky event like this!

03:21.140 --> 03:24.300
Right, Christmas is already coming up next week.

03:24.300 --> 03:29.180
This Santa Claus guy never came to me!

03:31.020 --> 03:35.290
Oh, who cares. This year, I'll claim all the ones I missed to this day.

03:35.290 --> 03:36.020
What's wrong?

03:36.630 --> 03:41.570
S-Sorry to say this, but only
children get presents from Santa Claus.

03:41.570 --> 03:45.780
In other words, you're a grown adult despite your appearance, so you can't get one.

03:46.590 --> 03:48.290
!?TAHW

03:59.360 --> 04:00.300
Gekka...

04:14.560 --> 04:16.270
Jerks!

04:20.690 --> 04:21.610
Can I have that?

04:21.610 --> 04:23.150
Sure.

04:34.510 --> 04:37.260
Mother hasn't come out since she locked herself in.

04:37.260 --> 04:38.630
It's been a whole week now.

04:38.630 --> 04:41.050
What could she be doing in there?

04:45.050 --> 04:47.640
Will Mom come out today?

04:48.150 --> 04:50.710
Don't worry. It's Kyouka we're talking about.

04:50.710 --> 04:52.410
She won't stay quiet on a day like this.

04:54.530 --> 04:55.910
All right, it's done.

04:55.910 --> 04:57.150
What was that?

04:58.550 --> 05:00.100
Perfect timing.

05:00.600 --> 05:01.230
Kyouka?

05:01.230 --> 05:04.150
Ouka, bring me food. Kyouka-sama's starving.

05:13.850 --> 05:16.670
Mother. Consider eating a little slower?

05:18.260 --> 05:20.080
Talk after you swallow.

05:21.170 --> 05:23.800
What have you been doing these past few days, Kitty?

05:23.800 --> 05:25.570
Some preparations.

05:25.570 --> 05:26.970
Preparations? For what?

05:26.970 --> 05:29.680
Oh no! It's already this late!

05:29.680 --> 05:30.670
Hyouka!

05:31.140 --> 05:32.990
I have something I want you to do.

05:32.990 --> 05:34.960
Come to Kyouka-sama's room later.

05:34.960 --> 05:35.740
Okay.

05:38.020 --> 05:40.020
Look forward to tomorrow.

05:42.000 --> 05:42.980
Mom?

05:44.020 --> 05:45.280
Mom...

06:09.760 --> 06:13.050
I guess I should start getting ready.

06:20.580 --> 06:21.620
What?

06:22.880 --> 06:23.950
I got him!

06:23.950 --> 06:25.990
Kyouka? What's going on here?

06:25.990 --> 06:28.740
The trap Kyouka-sama set activated!

06:28.740 --> 06:30.480
Trap?

06:34.330 --> 06:35.580
Over here?

06:35.580 --> 06:36.830
Charge!

06:41.970 --> 06:43.980
Where did he go?

06:43.980 --> 06:45.890
Give me an explanation, Kyouka!

06:45.890 --> 06:48.040
It's an auto-intercept program I installed into Hyouka.

06:48.040 --> 06:51.570
I set it so it activates if anyone other than a family member goes into Yuuka's room.

06:51.570 --> 06:52.580
You installed a program?

06:52.580 --> 06:55.220
Hey, Hyouka. Where did he go?

06:55.220 --> 06:56.380
Wake up, Hyouka!

06:56.380 --> 07:01.430
If you don't, I'll draw eyebrows, a mustache,
and other objects that can't be said out loud.

07:00.440 --> 07:01.850
Ow!

07:02.060 --> 07:05.070
Ow! Ow! It hurts! Help me!

07:05.070 --> 07:06.760
Help me, save me, I surrender!

07:06.760 --> 07:08.340
Ow ow ow ow.

07:08.660 --> 07:11.440
Good job, Teika! Keep her pinned!

07:12.090 --> 07:13.870
What in the world is going on here?

07:16.130 --> 07:18.370
Look, I caught Santa!

07:18.370 --> 07:19.990
Well done, Teika.

07:19.990 --> 07:23.880
It was a little different from my plan, but we have Santa Claus in our hands as planned!

07:23.880 --> 07:27.130
So this was the purpose of locking yourself in the room.

07:31.040 --> 07:33.060
Is this a real Santa Claus?

07:33.060 --> 07:35.410
She's really young, too.

07:35.410 --> 07:37.680
Besides, aren't the black clothes strange?

07:37.680 --> 07:39.800
This is the new trend.

07:39.800 --> 07:41.560
Santas have to be unique nowadays, too.

07:41.560 --> 07:42.140
Hey you!

07:42.700 --> 07:43.180
Yes?

07:43.180 --> 07:45.400
Are you really Santa Claus?

07:46.350 --> 07:48.890
Yes, more or less.

07:48.890 --> 07:52.380
*Stare*

07:53.590 --> 07:56.110
I see! So you really are Santa Claus!

07:56.110 --> 07:58.810
It's my pleasure to meet you, Santa girl.

07:58.810 --> 08:00.160
Handshake please.

08:01.970 --> 08:03.750
By the way, getting down to business.

08:04.600 --> 08:09.630
Why did you guys never leave a single present for me when I was a child?

08:11.460 --> 08:16.030
I hear you guys deliver presents only to good kids.

08:16.030 --> 08:17.510
R-Right...

08:17.510 --> 08:20.770
I don't know what the criteria for being a "good kid" are,

08:20.770 --> 08:26.770
but how could you not bring a present to this
Empress Kyouka, to whom everyone bows down before,

08:26.770 --> 08:30.470
whom everyone praises the accomplishments of,
and whom everyone brings offerings to.

08:30.470 --> 08:31.860
However that's in the past.

08:31.860 --> 08:35.620
Therefore there's only one thing I demand of you!

08:35.620 --> 08:39.790
Give me all the presents that I should have gotten to this day with interest!

08:39.790 --> 08:43.330
Set the range of "kids!" to be fifteen,
and add another fifteen years as interest!

08:43.330 --> 08:45.290
Give them to me! Right now!

08:45.290 --> 08:48.670
I will not compromise! I will demand what I deserve for righteous reasons!

08:48.670 --> 08:50.640
Give me presents~

08:50.640 --> 08:54.140
Don't you have all the toys in the world anyway?

09:02.180 --> 09:04.310
So here's my first year's!

09:08.890 --> 09:11.330
Hey, it's Gekka.

09:11.330 --> 09:15.300
I was wondering where she went.
Who knew you got wrapped up as a present.

09:17.290 --> 09:19.210
Cha-ching.

09:21.120 --> 09:26.200
Not only did you kidnap our daughter, how dare you wrap her up?!

09:26.200 --> 09:27.630
I will slice you to death!

09:27.630 --> 09:29.150
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

09:29.150 --> 09:32.200
I didn't mean it as harassment at all!

09:32.200 --> 09:35.780
Although I'm a Santa, I'm still only
an apprentice. I only have a permit!

09:35.780 --> 09:36.880
What?

09:36.880 --> 09:39.750
So I can't distribute presents well.

09:39.750 --> 09:41.890
I didn't do it on purpose. Please believe me!

09:44.400 --> 09:45.350
My nose...

09:48.340 --> 09:50.900
Doesn't look like you're lying.

09:52.370 --> 09:56.610
I can imagine how hard it is to deliver presents to all the kids in the world alone.

09:56.610 --> 09:58.320
It's much worse if you're still an apprentice.

09:58.360 --> 10:01.910
Yes, I'm alone. It's so hard. It's impossible.

10:02.310 --> 10:04.380
Okay, I managed to get out of that one.

10:04.380 --> 10:08.920
If they figured out what I actually am,
I couldn't imagine in what cruel way I would be killed.

10:08.920 --> 10:10.900
And what is up with this family?

10:10.900 --> 10:13.170
That weak-looking four-eyes looks normal,

10:13.170 --> 10:14.420
but a cat-ear,

10:14.420 --> 10:15.930
a robot,

10:15.930 --> 10:17.290
and a lion?

10:17.620 --> 10:22.460
Anyway, I'll just go with the flow here and get out when I get the chance.

10:22.460 --> 10:23.610
Hey, Santa girl.

10:23.610 --> 10:24.430
Yes?

10:24.430 --> 10:28.160
You said "I'm alone. It's so hard." Right?

10:28.160 --> 10:29.550
Y-Yes.

10:29.550 --> 10:33.190
Then what's that? That Santa Claus must be a fake, right?

10:33.190 --> 10:33.900
Grandp-

10:36.840 --> 10:38.370
Step aside. It's dangerous.

10:40.070 --> 10:40.950
Take this!

10:41.000 --> 10:43.540
You imposter!

10:48.370 --> 10:50.350
Rest assured, Santa girl.

10:50.350 --> 10:56.170
The imposter's been shot down by devil sergeant Kyouka-sama, who gets praised as the legendary hero in a forgotten war!

10:58.450 --> 10:59.650
Grandpa...

10:59.650 --> 11:00.470
Let's go now.

11:01.100 --> 11:04.430
I will make you into a full-fledged Santa Claus.

11:07.290 --> 11:10.390
Hey, cool. It really is flying.

11:10.390 --> 11:13.650
The people look like trash.
The city looks like trash, too.

11:13.650 --> 11:17.400
Make sure you clean up,
or else your mommy will spank your butt.

11:17.400 --> 11:18.910
Um, Kyouka-chan, right?

11:18.910 --> 11:21.560
What exactly do you plan on doing to make me a full-fledged Santa?

11:21.560 --> 11:24.560
Maybe not today, but one day if I do become full-fledged...

11:24.560 --> 11:26.450
Rest assured and leave everything to me.

11:26.450 --> 11:29.160
As a most wonderful fact, I, Kyouka-sama, am omniscient and omnipotent!

11:29.160 --> 11:30.020
You just wait!

11:30.020 --> 11:36.820
I'll make you the best Santa in history who'll distribute dreams and hope to kids in a way never seen in the art of Santaness!

11:51.580 --> 11:54.310
Hello all. Is everything ready?

11:54.310 --> 11:58.780
Ma'am! I've worked hard, sacrificing quality time with my girlfriend, Ma'am!

11:58.780 --> 12:01.320
Same with me, Ma'am! I will hate you, Ma'am!

12:01.320 --> 12:04.690
I see. So you all find it an honor to be able to take part in my mission, eh?

12:04.690 --> 12:06.080
Then work hard.

12:07.080 --> 12:09.950
Yes. We'll do our best.

12:09.950 --> 12:12.960
Roger that. Santa 03. Item: Hula hoop.

12:15.600 --> 12:16.320
Do it.

12:30.930 --> 12:33.920
You look pretty good in it, Santa girl.

12:34.400 --> 12:36.370
Why are you making me dress in this?

12:36.370 --> 12:38.410
Just black won't have enough impact.

12:38.410 --> 12:40.690
With the way you were, you wouldn't have gotten any attention from the kids these days.

12:41.190 --> 12:41.890
But...

12:43.140 --> 12:45.450
Your breast size looks nice. That is all.

12:45.450 --> 12:48.050
Everyone develops big ones without thinking of their surroundings.

12:46.040 --> 12:48.900
That's her opinion, but why even us?

12:48.050 --> 12:50.240
It's not the bigger the better.

12:48.900 --> 12:51.090
I look so good!

12:50.240 --> 12:51.860
That's right. Hips are what matter from now on.

12:51.860 --> 12:54.290
I will fight with my tiny cute hip.

12:54.290 --> 12:56.980
By the way, beautiful breasts and large breasts do not equate.

12:57.360 --> 12:59.070
Stop drooping complaints out your mouth.

12:59.070 --> 13:00.570
Drooping breasts are already enough to worry about.

13:00.570 --> 13:02.980
Ow ow. You'll stretch it.

13:02.980 --> 13:05.140
What should I do about this?

13:05.140 --> 13:09.350
I'm not too sure, but the situation's definitely developing in the wrong direction.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.390
Plus...

13:15.330 --> 13:17.890
It's nothing. It has nothing to do with me.

13:17.890 --> 13:19.190
Everyone! Attention!

13:22.590 --> 13:27.840
We will now start the holy night party hosted by the Midarezaki along with the help from Santa Claus.

13:27.840 --> 13:31.610
The obvious purpose of this party is to turn the Santa girl into a full-fledged Santa,

13:31.610 --> 13:36.210
but also to prevent children crying out due to not getting presents like me!

13:38.720 --> 13:41.520
You! Until which age did you believe in Santa Claus?

13:41.520 --> 13:42.710
Until eight, Ma'am!

13:43.210 --> 13:46.110
Why did you stop believing?!

13:46.680 --> 13:50.360
Because I saw my father putting on a fake beard, Ma'am!

13:50.680 --> 13:51.540
I see.

13:59.270 --> 14:01.630
What is inside your bag?!

14:01.630 --> 14:03.150
Ma'am! Presents, Ma'am!

14:03.150 --> 14:05.710
What exactly are presents?!

14:05.710 --> 14:07.660
Dreams and hopes, Ma'am!

14:07.660 --> 14:09.600
Answer me! Who are you guys?!

14:09.600 --> 14:10.750
Ma'am! Santa Claus, Ma'am!

14:10.750 --> 14:11.910
Say it again!

14:11.910 --> 14:13.050
Ma'am! Santa Claus, Ma'am!

14:13.050 --> 14:14.110
Let's repeat!

14:14.110 --> 14:15.120
Ma'am! Santa Claus, Ma'am!

14:15.120 --> 14:16.110
I can't hear you!

14:16.110 --> 14:18.180
Ma'am! Santa Claus, Ma'am!!

14:17.080 --> 14:19.460
Good, that's what I like to hear.

14:19.460 --> 14:21.260
Begin operation!

14:21.260 --> 14:22.390
Yes, Ma'am!

14:24.340 --> 14:26.470
Go, Santa Clauses!

14:31.890 --> 14:38.140
Show the kids your power,
take them down and trample them!

14:50.010 --> 14:51.910
Excuse me...

14:53.280 --> 14:54.630
Slowly...

14:55.160 --> 14:56.860
Who the hell are you?

15:05.310 --> 15:06.890
You saved me there, Ginka.

15:06.890 --> 15:10.360
Don't mention it. Anything for you, Father.

15:10.720 --> 15:12.910
Hyouka. What's our next destination?

15:12.910 --> 15:15.120
That house was the last in this area.

15:15.120 --> 15:17.430
Then let's go help Chika-san's group.

15:18.370 --> 15:22.460
Ouka-san's group finished distributing
in their area, so they said they'll come help us.

15:22.460 --> 15:24.820
Wow, they're so fast.

15:25.300 --> 15:27.630
We can't lose to them.

15:27.630 --> 15:28.440
That's right!

15:29.340 --> 15:31.440
Let's give it to her once it's all over.

15:32.140 --> 15:32.900
Yeah!

15:38.970 --> 15:41.080
Point A-15. Under control.

15:41.080 --> 15:41.920
Good.

15:50.020 --> 15:51.270
How much more left?

15:51.270 --> 15:52.760
20% more to go.

15:52.760 --> 15:56.230
At this rate, we'll finish distributing presents to all children in a matter of hours.

16:20.700 --> 16:21.580
Why?

16:23.070 --> 16:25.000
Why are you doing all this?

16:25.000 --> 16:28.050
They're all children you've never met.

16:28.050 --> 16:31.590
That's the reason why you can't become a full-fledged Santa.

16:33.380 --> 16:36.350
High-speed flying object coming in from 1:30.

16:36.820 --> 16:38.100
Vital signal present.

16:38.100 --> 16:38.850
A human?

16:38.850 --> 16:39.810
No, this is...

16:39.810 --> 16:40.850
A Santa Claus?

16:54.450 --> 16:55.610
Grandpa.

16:55.610 --> 16:57.120
Stay back, Santa girl!

16:57.760 --> 17:00.460
Fire! Keep him away from the command center!

17:02.370 --> 17:04.250
What's wrong? Why won't you guys fire?

17:04.250 --> 17:07.570
I can't! I can't possibly shoot Santa Claus!

17:07.570 --> 17:09.890
You idiot! I told you that's an imposter!

17:09.890 --> 17:12.550
I would become a naughty boy!

17:12.560 --> 17:13.980
You worthless bunch!

17:14.430 --> 17:18.550
You think you can deceive me with that beard, you fake Santa Claus!

17:32.020 --> 17:34.140
To stop my punch...

17:34.140 --> 17:35.910
Not bad for an imposter.

17:45.020 --> 17:46.290
What is going on?

18:02.760 --> 18:04.460
Mother is losing?

18:04.460 --> 18:07.570
I think there are more points to comment on.

18:13.610 --> 18:15.820
God damn it.

18:22.910 --> 18:23.870
Nice one!

18:23.870 --> 18:26.470
How's my strength?

18:26.470 --> 18:27.370
What?

18:30.790 --> 18:32.550
Merry...

18:32.550 --> 18:35.300
Christmas!

18:38.960 --> 18:41.930
You've made me serious now.

18:41.930 --> 18:44.680
There is no chance of giving you any mercy now!

18:47.770 --> 18:48.910
Wh-What?

18:48.910 --> 18:50.440
That stance! It can't be!

18:53.980 --> 18:54.780
Bring it on!

18:54.780 --> 18:55.780
She's fast!

18:59.160 --> 19:00.240
I hate it!

19:00.240 --> 19:02.790
I hate you and your work, too!

19:16.090 --> 19:18.810
No! Santa Claus!

19:18.810 --> 19:20.090
How could I...

19:21.470 --> 19:25.100
Amazing. You've got great skills to push me that far.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.660
What a waste.

19:27.030 --> 19:29.700
What a waste to leave you as the imposter.

19:30.270 --> 19:34.270
But this is the smallest bit of mercy for you! I'll finish you so you won't feel any pain!

19:34.770 --> 19:35.780
Don't!

19:40.560 --> 19:42.420
Kitty disappeared?

19:43.010 --> 19:44.950
That's ridiculous.

19:45.300 --> 19:46.070
Where did she go?

19:47.890 --> 19:50.500
Hey, did we have this huge present before?

19:52.190 --> 19:54.000
The present moves! It's a spook!

19:54.000 --> 19:55.850
Where's my enemy?!

19:56.640 --> 19:58.010
Hi Mother.

19:58.010 --> 20:00.320
I get it. It's an illusion.

20:00.320 --> 20:02.250
Do you really think so?

20:04.440 --> 20:05.510
Where am I?

20:06.180 --> 20:07.120
Chloe.

20:07.590 --> 20:11.040
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

20:16.420 --> 20:18.020
Hold it right there.

20:18.950 --> 20:19.940
Kyouka-chan.

20:19.940 --> 20:23.500
I don't really get it, but I won't allow a happy ending that leaves me out!

20:23.500 --> 20:25.450
Kyouka! You've had enough fun, haven't you?!

20:27.830 --> 20:30.820
B-But I haven't gotten a present...

20:30.820 --> 20:31.580
Here.

20:33.000 --> 20:37.750
Merry Christmas. It's a present from me to you.

20:38.180 --> 20:39.580
This is from me.

20:40.490 --> 20:44.010
I don't really know about presents, but I did my best and bought one.

20:44.010 --> 20:48.010
I'm not familiar with human preferences, so it was hard to choose.

20:48.950 --> 20:51.580
Oh, so everyone had something prepared?

20:51.580 --> 20:53.550
Looks like we all think alike.

20:53.550 --> 20:55.690
Merry Christmas.

20:55.690 --> 20:58.480
Y-You guys...

21:00.070 --> 21:05.070
Y-You idiots. How do you expect me to take all these home?

21:05.070 --> 21:10.370
Besides, what is this? I can't use cute gloves like these.

21:10.370 --> 21:13.720
And Hyouka. What exactly is this?

21:13.720 --> 21:16.580
Will it triple my stats if I equip it?

21:16.580 --> 21:21.950
Why did none of you tell me about this before?

21:17.630 --> 21:20.270
Why does she look so happy?

21:21.950 --> 21:23.010
Grandpa.

21:23.010 --> 21:28.080
Look. Anyone who gives a present will receive a piece of happiness in return.

21:28.600 --> 21:31.890
A piece of happiness...

21:34.540 --> 21:38.380
There still are many children waiting for their presents.

21:38.380 --> 21:40.200
Will you help me?

21:40.920 --> 21:41.480
Yup!

21:44.610 --> 21:50.110
Bye bye, Santa Claus.

21:52.510 --> 21:56.620
Our night has just begun.

21:57.220 --> 21:59.230
Yup, Grandpa.

22:20.860 --> 22:24.080
Why do you climb the mountain?
Because the mountain is there to be climbed!

22:24.080 --> 22:25.400
But Kyouka-sama won't!

22:25.400 --> 22:29.900
If it stands in my way, I shall pulverize it to dust
in a split-second, whether it be mountain or planet!

23:40.470 --> 23:42.500
Dad! Take a seat right here!

23:42.500 --> 23:43.770
Give me a clear explanation!

23:43.770 --> 23:45.360
Gosh, why are all men...

23:45.360 --> 23:48.400
This time, even if Mom forgives you, I won't!

23:48.400 --> 23:52.590
You have a wife and children, and are living with a happy family, yet why are men so...

23:50.530 --> 23:52.590
Next time, The Fallen Princess.

23:52.590 --> 23:54.200
Listen when others are talking!
